  <div id="scan-type-modal" class="absolute inset-0 z-30 hidden items-center justify-center bg-black/70 p-5"><div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 text-slate-800 shadow-2xl"><h1 class="text-xl font-black">Choose attendance action</h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Select what the live camera should record.</p><div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><button type="button" data-scan-type="time_in" class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-4 text-left font-bold text-white hover:bg-emerald-700"><span class="block text-lg">Time in</span><span class="mt-1 block text-xs font-medium text-emerald-100">Record each student's arrival</span></button><button type="button" data-scan-type="time_out" class="rounded-xl bg-amber-500 px-4 py-4 text-left font-bold text-white hover:bg-amber-600"><span class="block text-lg">Time out</span><span class="mt-1 block text-xs font-medium text-amber-50">Record each student's departure</span></button></div><button id="cancel-scan-type" type="button" class="mt-4 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50">Cancel</button></div></div>
